[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8347.589, "timestamp": "02:19:07", "text": "我想知道她是否应该试试。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8355.589, "timestamp": "02:19:15", "text": "但这也让她进入了一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8357.91, "timestamp": "02:19:17", "text": "以为是假发，对吧？这就是我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8362.15, "timestamp": "02:19:22", "text": "我们当时是想逃跑，而不是真的要这么做。所以，在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8366.44, "timestamp": "02:19:26", "text": "某种程度上来说，会是的。再见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8373.509, "timestamp": "02:19:33", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8376.87, "timestamp": "02:19:36", "text": "我可能会重新加载存档。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8384.549, "timestamp": "02:19:44", "text": "我可能会以某种方式重新开始这一天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8388.34, "timestamp": "02:19:48", "text": "如果情况恶化的话。我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8395.85, "timestamp": "02:19:55", "text": "但最重要的是，我们在这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8397.19, "timestamp": "02:19:57", "text": "[音乐]"}]